translate brazil lb_ep03_04_02_The_Art_Gallery_Heist_Part_1_be2043be:

#   b "And he badly needed to use the bathroom."
    b "E ele precisava muito usar o banheiro."

# game/scripts/Episode 03/Day 4/04_02_The_Art_Gallery_Heist_Part_1.rpy:600
translate brazil lb_ep03_04_02_The_Art_Gallery_Heist_Part_1_ca468254:

#   b "He drinks like a fish this one."
    b "Esse aí bebe como um peixe."

# game/scripts/Episode 03/Day 4/04_02_The_Art_Gallery_Heist_Part_1.rpy:603
translate brazil lb_ep03_04_02_The_Art_Gallery_Heist_Part_1_dce6062a:

#   security "You two shouldn’t be here. This is a restricted access area."
    security "Vocês dois não deveriam estar aqui. Esta é uma área de acesso restrito."

# game/scripts/Episode 03/Day 4/04_02_The_Art_Gallery_Heist_Part_1.rpy:605
translate brazil lb_ep03_04_02_The_Art_Gallery_Heist_Part_1_783a68f6:

#   b "We understand. And we didn’t mean to cause any trouble."
    b "Nós entendemos. E não tínhamos a intenção de causar nenhum problema."

# game/scripts/Episode 03/Day 4/04_02_The_Art_Gallery_Heist_Part_1.rpy:607
translate brazil lb_ep03_04_02_The_Art_Gallery_Heist_Part_1_db69c875:

#   b "Would you be so kind as to escort us back to the party, please?"
    b "Você teria a gentileza de nos acompanhar de volta à festa, por favor?"

# game/scripts/Episode 03/Day 4/04_02_The_Art_Gallery_Heist_Part_1.rpy:618
translate brazil lb_ep03_04_02_The_Art_Gallery_Heist_Part_1_d4adba11:

#   mc "{i}(*Whispering*){/i}\nMaybe next time, give me a heads-up when you’re going to take the lead like that, [b_name]."
    mc "{i}(*Sussurrando*){/i}Talvez da próxima vez, me avise com antecedência quando for tomar a iniciativa assim. [b_name]."

# game/scripts/Episode 03/Day 4/04_02_The_Art_Gallery_Heist_Part_1.rpy:620
translate brazil lb_ep03_04_02_The_Art_Gallery_Heist_Part_1_8acd85f3:

#   b "{i}(*Whispering*){/i}\nI didn’t want you thinking. You’re not very good at that."
    b "{i}(*Sussurrando*){/i}Eu não queria que você pensasse. Você não é muito bom nisso."

# game/scripts/Episode 03/Day 4/04_02_The_Art_Gallery_Heist_Part_1.rpy:622
translate brazil lb_ep03_04_02_The_Art_Gallery_Heist_Part_1_c9b034cd:

#   mc "Pftt!"
    mc "Pftt!"

# game/scripts/Episode 03/Day 4/04_02_The_Art_Gallery_Heist_Part_1.rpy:625
translate brazil lb_ep03_04_02_The_Art_Gallery_Heist_Part_1_a7543652:

#   b "{i}(*Whispering*){/i}\nOh, look at you, searching for a witty comeback."
    b "{i}(*Sussurrando*){/i}Olha só você, procurando uma resposta espirituosa."

# game/scripts/Episode 03/Day 4/04_02_The_Art_Gallery_Heist_Part_1.rpy:627
translate brazil lb_ep03_04_02_The_Art_Gallery_Heist_Part_1_5a3e2169:

#   mc "{i}(*Whispering*){/i}\nScrew you."
    mc "{i}(*Sussurrando*){/i}Que se dane você."

# game/scripts/Episode 03/Day 4/04_02_The_Art_Gallery_Heist_Part_1.rpy:629
translate brazil lb_ep03_04_02_The_Art_Gallery_Heist_Part_1_fe2f4c71:

#   b "{i}(*Whispering*){/i}\nHow very George Orwell of you."
    b "{i}(*Sussurrando*){/i}Que atitude bem George Orwell a sua."

# game/scripts/Episode 03/Day 4/04_02_The_Art_Gallery_Heist_Part_1.rpy:649
translate brazil lb_ep03_04_02_The_Art_Gallery_Heist_Part_1_7ab46887:

#   woman "So who would say is your greatest inspiration for this specific piece of work, Miss Veerhart?"
    woman "Então, quem você diria que é a sua maior inspiração para esta obra específica, Srta. Veerhart?"

# game/scripts/Episode 03/Day 4/04_02_The_Art_Gallery_Heist_Part_1.rpy:651
translate brazil lb_ep03_04_02_The_Art_Gallery_Heist_Part_1_f997f572:

#   v "I would say it was my mother."
    v "Eu diria que foi minha mãe."

# game/scripts/Episode 03/Day 4/04_02_The_Art_Gallery_Heist_Part_1.rpy:653
translate brazil lb_ep03_04_02_The_Art_Gallery_Heist_Part_1_e8b35cfe:

#   v "She was very troubled woman, quite insecure, even though she had kind nature."
    v "Ela era uma mulher muito problemática, bastante insegura, embora tivesse uma natureza bondosa."

# game/scripts/Episode 03/Day 4/04_02_The_Art_Gallery_Heist_Part_1.rpy:655
translate brazil lb_ep03_04_02_The_Art_Gallery_Heist_Part_1_fa848922:

#   v "In my work, I wanted to capture something of her mood, using memories from childhood."
    v "Em meu trabalho, quis capturar algo de seu estado de espírito, usando memórias da infância."

# game/scripts/Episode 03/Day 4/04_02_The_Art_Gallery_Heist_Part_1.rpy:657
translate brazil lb_ep03_04_02_The_Art_Gallery_Heist_Part_1_1e08aca5:

#   woman "What was her reaction when she saw it?"
    woman "Qual foi a reação dela ao ver isso?"

# game/scripts/Episode 03/Day 4/04_02_The_Art_Gallery_Heist_Part_1.rpy:659
translate brazil lb_ep03_04_02_The_Art_Gallery_Heist_Part_1_c44d763d:

#   v "She did not. She passed away before she ever got chance."
    v "Não. Ela faleceu antes mesmo de ter essa chance."

# game/scripts/Episode 03/Day 4/04_02_The_Art_Gallery_Heist_Part_1.rpy:661
translate brazil lb_ep03_04_02_The_Art_Gallery_Heist_Part_1_e2e66373:

#   woman "But in your book, it said that she was still alive when you’re painting was first unveiled to the public."
    woman "Mas no seu livro, dizia que ela ainda estava viva quando sua pintura foi apresentada ao público pela primeira vez."

# game/scripts/Episode 03/Day 4/04_02_The_Art_Gallery_Heist_Part_1.rpy:663
translate brazil lb_ep03_04_02_The_Art_Gallery_Heist_Part_1_aaa7483a:

#   v "The book is not always accurate to every event."
    v "O livro nem sempre retrata com precisão todos os acontecimentos."

# game/scripts/Episode 03/Day 4/04_02_The_Art_Gallery_Heist_Part_1.rpy:665
translate brazil lb_ep03_04_02_The_Art_Gallery_Heist_Part_1_9c954f13:

#   v "In final years of her life, my mother rarely left house, not even her bedroom, so she couldn’t see painting I made for her."
    v "Nos últimos anos de sua vida, minha mãe raramente saía de casa, nem mesmo do quarto, então ela não pôde ver a pintura que fiz para ela."

# game/scripts/Episode 03/Day 4/04_02_The_Art_Gallery_Heist_Part_1.rpy:667
translate brazil lb_ep03_04_02_The_Art_Gallery_Heist_Part_1_7d8daa84:

#   v "Even showing her photos on my phone, she did not believe I painted it. Her mind had already declined so much."
    v "Mesmo mostrando as fotos no meu celular, ela não acreditou que eu havia pintado. Seu estado mental já estava bastante comprometido."

# game/scripts/Episode 03/Day 4/04_02_The_Art_Gallery_Heist_Part_1.rpy:669
translate brazil lb_ep03_04_02_The_Art_Gallery_Heist_Part_1_d6d5b59b:

#   woman "Oh, I see..."
    woman "Oh, eu vejo..."

# game/scripts/Episode 03/Day 4/04_02_The_Art_Gallery_Heist_Part_1.rpy:672
translate brazil lb_ep03_04_02_The_Art_Gallery_Heist_Part_1_c22f9a2e:

#   mc "{i}(*Whispering*){/i}\nDamn, she’s good."
    mc "{i}(*Sussurrando*){/i}Caramba, ela é boa mesmo."

# game/scripts/Episode 03/Day 4/04_02_The_Art_Gallery_Heist_Part_1.rpy:675
translate brazil lb_ep03_04_02_The_Art_Gallery_Heist_Part_1_b47473b6:

#   b "{i}(*Whispering*){/i}\nYeah, [mc_v_address] has them all fooled."
    b "{i}(*Sussurrando*){/i}Sim, [mc_v_address] enganou a todos."

# game/scripts/Episode 03/Day 4/04_02_The_Art_Gallery_Heist_Part_1.rpy:678
translate brazil lb_ep03_04_02_The_Art_Gallery_Heist_Part_1_ad30a23a:

#   "Okay, I think that should just about do it."
    "Ok, acho que isso deve resolver o problema."

# game/scripts/Episode 03/Day 4/04_02_The_Art_Gallery_Heist_Part_1.rpy:680
translate brazil lb_ep03_04_02_The_Art_Gallery_Heist_Part_1_54210420:

#   "Miss Veerhart will not be answering any more questions."
    "A Srta. Veerhart não responderá a mais perguntas."

# game/scripts/Episode 03/Day 4/04_02_The_Art_Gallery_Heist_Part_1.rpy:682
translate brazil lb_ep03_04_02_The_Art_Gallery_Heist_Part_1_23f5a5bc:

#   "Can we please give her a round of applause for attending today and sharing her valuable time with us this afternoon?"
    "Podemos, por favor, dar-lhe uma salva de palmas por ter comparecido hoje e por ter dedicado seu valioso tempo a nós esta tarde?"

# game/scripts/Episode 03/Day 4/04_02_The_Art_Gallery_Heist_Part_1.rpy:686
translate brazil lb_ep03_04_02_The_Art_Gallery_Heist_Part_1_a2803c48:

#   vic "All right, phase one is just about done."
    vic "Muito bem, a primeira fase está quase concluída."

# game/scripts/Episode 03/Day 4/04_02_The_Art_Gallery_Heist_Part_1.rpy:689
translate brazil lb_ep03_04_02_The_Art_Gallery_Heist_Part_1_0be26a3a:

#   vic "You two should start making your way out of there as soon as you can."
    vic "Vocês dois devem começar a sair daí o mais rápido possível."

# game/scripts/Episode 03/Day 4/04_02_The_Art_Gallery_Heist_Part_1.rpy:692
translate brazil lb_ep03_04_02_The_Art_Gallery_Heist_Part_1_3b305266:

#   b "{i}(*Whispering*){/i}\nWhat about [mc_v_address]?"
    b "{i}(*Sussurrando*){/i}E quanto a...? [mc_v_address]?"

